-4743-b9c2-d317cee728c0")) (text "ISOLATION BARRIER: J600, R600, D600 and U600 pins 1-3 are the isolated side. Keep >= 8 mm creepage and clearance to all other copper (slot under U600). J600 shell is not board GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 173.726 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4f60396b-0d5b-42d5-92a0-5bb66369bcb2")) (text "Trigger input 3.0-5.0 V logic, active high, 2-6 mA LED current. U600 inverts: trigger high gives TRIGGER_ISO low; firmware captures both edges." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 175.911 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff20f617-9886-4d8a-ba5a-881748b1ab5e")) (text "Photodiode: passive sensor only (e.g. BPW34). Not isolated: treat as participant-side like the electrodes. TIA Vout = 50 mV + Iph x 33k; DAC POR code 0 = no edges until calibrated." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 178.096 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "776f2225-08da-43be-b4bc-1c2a6e04ef0a")))